pecifically, this figure illustrates the process of converting raw data into a three-dimensional numerical vector. Video sample Audio sample Text sample Video embedding model Audio embedding model Text embedding model Video embedding vector Audio embedding vector Text embedding vector 1.23 -0.31 0.89 -0.15 0.45 2.11 1.78 0.18 -2.10 Embedding model converts raw input into a vector representation Unlabeled input data Vector representation of the input"
